{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\nThe tickets branch/store is reported over 1 GiB after closed epic censual-organic-mouflon claimed a one-time history rewrite reduced a fresh unfiltered clone to <=150 MB and bounded reconciler cache churn. Prior history implicates reconciler operations, but this investigation must not assume that diagnosis still explains current retained bytes.\n\n## Plan\n- Distinguish remote branch reachability, local shared-object storage, working-tree size, and unreachable/reflog-pinned objects.\n- Measure object counts and packed/delta-compressed bytes by type, path, commit/time interval, producer/commit shape, and ref reachability.\n- Reproduce the size from a fresh unfiltered clone or otherwise prove the report is local-retention behavior.\n- Compare current growth with the prior reclaim baseline and test reconciler churn against competing hypotheses such as high commit/tree volume, snapshots/events, signatures, merge topology, ref pins, and unreachable pre-rewrite history.\n- Trace any confirmed growth mechanism to the exact changeable artifact and originating ticket/commit; record an evidence-backed RCA only. No production-code repair is authorized in this ticket.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Current size is quantified separately for fresh remote reachability, local shared object storage, checkout contents, and unreachable/pinned objects.\n- [x] Retained bytes are attributed by Git object type and historical path with reproducible commands.\n- [x] The reconciler hypothesis and plausible alternatives each receive falsifiable tests, with outcomes recorded.\n- [x] The result explains whether the prior reclaim failed, regressed, or remains effective while another mechanism accounts for the observation.\n- [x] The confirmed root cause and defect origin (or rigorous unattributable finding) are recorded on this ticket with residual risks."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1787524891251584001,"uuid":"8ea016d9-1350-44cd-88e8-f2b7a90dd68c"}